Use tools/nova_historical_charts.py for an explicit local symbol/day, or
tools/nova_charts.py for a hashed historical_ohlcv selection. Read the Historical
OHLCV chart gateway in architecture/schema/agent-desk.md and the resolver contract
in architecture/schema/local-historical-charts.md before changing behavior.

Generic annotations are limited to horizontal_line and time_marker with bounded
labels and fixed named colors. Preserve raw same-session units, observed gaps and
source hashes. No as_of_m means full observed session; otherwise shade whole
later/crossing candles amber. Do not implement an alternate candle renderer.

No discovery/download, live bars, broker history, subscriptions, account mutation
or simulation commands are part of this offline path. MCP client setup and grants
are explicit separate actions. Report initialized and cold timing stages separately;
a subsecond target is not an unmeasured total-command claim.
